--[[
    Srilangish Hub - Cashier Autofarm (VirtualUser Input Version)
    Features: Strictly targets CA$HIER models with an 'Open' part inside, 
    uses VirtualUser for holding/clicking instead of mouse1press, 
    teleports to the blue void platform if none are available, grey square UI, and getgenv configuration.
]]
if not game:IsLoaded() then
    game.Loaded:Wait()
end

